p 1: Stop/Disable kubernetes

In Docker Desktop:
 Settings->Kubernetes-> Disable Kubenetes
 Then wait until Kubernetes has completely stopped
 
 Step 2: First remove all containers
 docker rm -f $(docker ps -aq)
 
 Remove all images
 
 docker rmi -f $(docker images -aq)
 
 Then clean everything else:
 
 docker system prune -a --volumes -f
 
 docker builder prune -a -f

 
 Step 3: Verify
 
 docker ps -a
 docker images
